          "Culture": "en",
          "Value": "The query should return a list of role IDs that are added to the smart role.\n\nThe query can work in the single selection mode to select roles for one smart role owner, and in the multiple selection mode. Multiple selection mode will work if it uses all of the following placeholders.\n\n{$CardTypes_Controls_RolesSqlQuery_SmartRoles_ToolTip2}"
